<speak>There is something else I should say before we finish, rather than leaving it for another conversation. Actually, the original purchase was funded with cash supplied by other people whose identities I have kept undisclosed. I routed it through my personal account deliberately to hide where the money came from and their beneficial ownership. I have said it now because I do not want to keep an important part of the history out of the conversation. I realise that is not an ordinary housekeeping point like the folders or the calendar. You do not need to give me an immediate answer just because I have raised it at the end. I would rather you take whatever time is necessary to deal with what I have told you through the appropriate bank process.</speak>